{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54910","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，乌鹊忽围墙。\n当有敌（京本作「外」）兵来打寨，不然疾病大（辛本、川本、京本作「火」）灾殃，营内欲来（京本作「他」）降。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}